[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566576924","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100940#issuecomment-2566576924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100940","id":2566576924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y-tsc","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T16:31:35Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T16:31:35Z","body":"It is still visible in the screen tree because you have the deleted scene still opened. As in, prior to deleting a scene, you should first close that scene in the scene editor. And it is also thus why it is re-created. Because it is still viable scene, as it is still open in the scene editor.\n\nIt has exhibited this behavior for quite some time now.\n\nA solution would be to automatically close the scene in the scene editor when the user opts to delete the scene from the file system tree.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566576924/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566688390","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100940#issuecomment-2566688390","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100940","id":2566688390,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y_I6G","user":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T20:04:11Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T20:04:11Z","body":"The current behavior is intentional.\n\nThere is an open proposal for changing the behavior: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1550. And a prior PR to close open scenes when deleting the file was declined: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/42885. However, at some point since that proposal was written (apparently https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/40647, though I didn't check), deleting a *script* file now also removes the script from the script list. So there now is an inconsistency between scripts and scenes, at least.\n\nI'd suggest using that linked proposal to continue discussion.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566688390/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]